 .../dts/renesas/r8a779g5-whitehawk-native.dts | 20 +++++
 .../dts/renesas/white-hawk-native-common.dtsi | 81 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../boot/dts/renesas/white-hawk-native.dtsi   | 39 +++++++++
 7 files changed, 204 insertions(+)
